    {
        "type": "function",
        "function": {
            "name": "post_message",
            "arguments": {
                "text": "seller_2: requesting the latest prices from all sellers for market day 2.",
                "channel": "public"
            }
        }
    }
]
```

Great! Our request for the latest prices has been successfully posted on the public board. Now we can review the prices and decide on our strategy for market day 2.

